# Direction

- Hook: `useDirection()` from `@/hooks/use-direction`.
- Direction is managed via `DirectionProvider` on the document root.
- Prefer logical CSS (`margin-inline`, `padding-inline`, `start`, `end`) over raw left/right when supporting bidirectional layouts.
- Do not set `dir` ad hoc on random nodes; wire via `DirectionProvider`.
